rtOffset":0,"endOffset":218,"text":"本说明由项目编写，资料接口字段参考所列文档。PokéAPI提供宝可梦、物种、招式和其他结构化资源。本地参考快照保留来源URL、抓取时间和摘要，缓存可以复用，但它不是官方赛事规则公告。不能根据物种存在或图鉴有数据，就判断其能参加当前排位。朱紫招式列表按接口中scarlet-violet的版本组过滤；这不能代替特定补丁、赛事或配招组合的完整合法性检查。回答当前强势阵容时需要有日期和赛制相符的使用率、赛事等证据；没有这些证据，应明确限制。","contentHash":"sha256:646ecf409f2ddb19c067dd0978eb3aecf62924e395a81f58848a83780baaa163"}},{"document":{"id":"species-form-identity-v1","title":"查询资料时区分物种、形态与编号","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"物种 形态 编号 slug 名字 form species 图鉴 查询","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"这份笔记说明本项目如何识别查询对象，不是物种强度或参赛名单。查询前先确认想了解的是哪一种形态。项目资料适配器分别读取宝可梦资源与物种资源；formId来自宝可梦资源编号，speciesId和全国编号来自物种资源，slug保留宝可梦资源名称。物种与形态的标识不能互相替代。回答和队伍配置应围绕同一个formId，不要只凭中文名称合并资料。\n\n遇到地区形态或同名对象时，应请用户确认具体形态，再读取该对象的属性和六项种族值。宝可梦资源可以与物种记录关联，但这种关联不证明两个形态拥有相同的招式、特性或比赛资格。资料中的本地参考标记只说明来源模式，不表示该对象符合当前排位。名称或编号查不到时应说明查询失败，不能换成相似名字后继续给出确定结论。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["reference"]}},"score":7223,"checksum":"sha256:1e072067cf84cbf202f49f5662d9939dcbba2173aa6691027761216f866784d7","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-7e6601704c34f8abb9d4352fb6a5104d46eed7159bb547f37892e1d4e2067145","documentVersion":"sha256:e4bf71833425a866cfa35a6a2dd4df2ebfbea9fe7dc4f7e7d64fc869c3274583","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":170,"endOffset":319,"text":"遇到地区形态或同名对象时，应请用户确认具体形态，再读取该对象的属性和六项种族值。宝可梦资源可以与物种记录关联，但这种关联不证明两个形态拥有相同的招式、特性或比赛资格。资料中的本地参考标记只说明来源模式，不表示该对象符合当前排位。名称或编号查不到时应说明查询失败，不能换成相似名字后继续给出确定结论。","contentHash":"sha256:5f52b20fb6f744e63661e12e566b49fc4559b4c41131b0c8a4525ac730b7cb55"}},{"document":{"id":"move-version-and-identifiers-v1","title":"朱紫招式候选与英文标识","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"招式 候选 版本 学习 英文 名称 slug moves 配招","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"本项目把招式查询与招式选择分开。成员资料中的候选招式按PokéAPI的版本组记录筛选，只收集scarlet-violet对应条目；这一步用于限定参考范围，不能等同于特定补丁、赛事或招式组合的合法性审核。候选列表为空时，只能说明当前参考数据没有取得相应候选，不能断言这只宝可梦没有招式。\n\n填写和计算时优先使用工具实际返回的英文名称或slug，不要由中文名称猜造标识。可再用lookupPokemonResource读取move资源，核对其返回字段。队伍配置最多保存四个不重复招式；保存成功只代表输入满足项目边界。决定配招前还需明确成员角色、目标对局和规则，缺少机制或学习途径证据时先说明不足，而不是从名称推测威力或效果。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["resource"]}},"score":7179,"checksum":"sha256:5cab5c1bc4a68580ac7433747f28ee6d36fabd9b39b1d95156f78ef09820a949","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-0817023bbaaf399e86e9e3d7ddd9877fdfe793b96c54e87f39ec570c8f317614","documentVersion":"sha256:350b8c4603e2cb087d61f8fc7dd1ce9afb98a2980112eae389917e7befdaabda","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":144,"endOffset":310,"text":"填写和计算时优先使用工具实际返回的英文名称或slug，不要由中文名称猜造标识。可再用lookupPokemonResource读取move资源，核对其返回字段。队伍配置最多保存四个不重复招式；保存成功只代表输入满足项目边界。决定配招前还需明确成员角色、目标对局和规则，缺少机制或学习途径证据时先说明不足，而不是从名称推测威力或效果。","contentHash":"sha256:a4cf81da0e2e3a7af1307dad29cb9dac10473c045bfc4c1c7b788dfbc89f5bc5"}},{"document":{"id":"ability-item-traceability-v1","title":"特性与道具先查询，再核对计算回读","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"特性 道具 ability item 查询 资源 机制 回读 标识","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"项目可通过lookupPokemonResource查询ability与item资源，也可查询move和nature。资料接口返回的是允许字段中的可用内容，并附来源和本地参考身份。没有返回某项机制说明时，应明确资料不足，不要仅凭名字猜测其效果。成员特性候选与当前保存特性也需分开：候选只说明资料列出这个名称，不代表用户已经选择它。\n\n本地计算桥接会验证非空的特性与道具名称，无法识别时拒绝计算。计算完成后应核对assumptions中实际使用的名称；缺省或未填写的配置不能被解读为某个道具已生效。队伍存储只验证名称输入边界，不提供特性、道具和物种的完整搭配合法性审查。推荐某个组合之前，还需要规则与机制支持，不能由保存成功推出组合合法或最优。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"},{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["resource"]}},"score":4377,"checksum":"sha256:3c8d70531f85fa933fbb2b3e7d0c7c1308e3c422aa1907e8ad1ab5bd9435946c","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-d27e56e88f9d1e9ab37edbd12e15e843217300573b42006cf0daa47b4be5bca9","documentVersion":"sha256:95ee64bb91153af9b31cbe76fabcdaaf3523bc072996a7b2314c082ba77ad2a8","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":167,"endOffset":321,"text":"本地计算桥接会验证非空的特性与道具名称，无法识别时拒绝计算。计算完成后应核对assumptions中实际使用的名称；缺省或未填写的配置不能被解读为某个道具已生效。队伍存储只验证名称输入边界，不提供特性、道具和物种的完整搭配合法性审查。推荐某个组合之前，还需要规则与机制支持，不能由保存成功推出组合合法或最优。","contentHash":"sha256:453e4b71c393435ff20cf137a081385ccd7d886c51785d1d987cbc3bca87f847"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@739e34f6}
